or&#xa;(legacy write 노드)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=9;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="llm"><mxGeometry x="15" y="100" width="130" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v68" value="AzureChatOpenAI 모델&#xa;(deep 메인·서브 공유)&#xa;+ NoCallChatModel(재생)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=9;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="llm"><mxGeometry x="155" y="100" width="130" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v69" value="intent.py&#xa;IntentClassifier&#xa;(maintain 의도 분류)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=9;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="llm"><mxGeometry x="295" y="100" width="130" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v70" value="embeddings.py [신규]&#xa;판단 메모 상황 임베딩&#xa;(자연어만 · 코드 검색 금지)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=9;align=center;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="llm"><mxGeometry x="435" y="100" width="130" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v71" value="replay.py 카세트 v1 · model_cassette.py 카세트 v2(미들웨어) · embeddings 기록(글→벡터)&#xa;요청 키 = deployment+시스템 프롬프트+메시지+도구 이름 · 완전 일치 · 폴백 없음" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="llm"><mxGeometry x="15" y="175" width="370" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v72" value="metering.py 토큰·예산&#xa;masking.py 시크릿 가림" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="llm"><mxGeometry x="395" y="175" width="170" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v73" value="prompts/*.md: system · write_test · write_test_append · classify_intent (코드 밖 데이터)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="llm"><mxGeometry x="15" y="240" width="550" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v74" value="사내 LLM 게이트웨이&#xa;Azure OpenAI 호환 · deployment = 모델(gpt-5)&#xa;주소·키는 환경변수/.env로만" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=center;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="110" width="400" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e75" value="HTTPS (실호출 시)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="llm" target="v74"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e76" value="생성 요청 / 모델 호출" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.2;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.2;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="engine" target="llm"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="safe" value="안전장치 — 결정적, LLM 호출 없음 (R2). 테스트를 만든 에이전트는 판정에 관여하지 못한다" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="560" width="580" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v77" value="게이트 루프 core/submit.py generate_with_gates&#xa;run_writer → 게이트 → 탈락 사유를 지침서에 붙여 재생성 (max_retries 기본 3)&#xa;소진 시 human_review(사람 확인) · 엔진 실패 시 not_passed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="safe"><mxGeometry x="15" y="40" width="550" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v78" value="게이트 6개 — core/gates.py 실행기 + adapters/java/gates.py·mutation.py·regression.py&#xa;① AssertIntegrity(메서드 단위·허용 목록) ② SkipAnnotation ③ FileScope(허용 파일만)&#xa;④ Coverage(JaCoCo 변경 라인 80% / 분기 70%, 회귀 금지) ⑤ Mutation(PIT 검출률) ⑥ BugReproduction(수정 전 코드에서 실패해야)&#xa;--fast는 ④⑤ 생략. 애매하면 탈락 → 사람 확인(보수적)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="safe"><mxGeometry x="15" y="115" width="550" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v79" value="조치 결정 규칙표 core/pipeline/decide.py (maintain)&#xa;(의도 × 기존 테스트 상태) → create_test / no_action / escalate / ask&#xa;refactor+실패 → escalate · unclear → ask · trivial → no_action. 기대값 자동 갱신 행 없음(R3)&#xa;영향 범위(호출자, 추정)는 지침서 내용에만 — 길(kind)에는 못 들어간다(ADR-0026 D2)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="safe"><mxGeometry x="15" y="210" width="550" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v80" value="반복 상한 core/agent/limits.py RunLedger&#xa;시도 ≤8(하드 캡) · 4회마다 묻기 · 같은 실패 2회 → ask · 시간 초과/실행 거부 → impossible" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="safe"><mxGeometry x="15" y="285" width="320" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v81" value="사람 개입 core/user_gate.py&#xa;InterruptUserGate: interrupt()로 정지 →&#xa;터미널 질문 → 답으로 같은 지점 재개" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce8f6;strokeColor=#b5739d;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="safe"><mxGeometry x="350" y="285" width="215" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v82" value="cta.toml [gates]·[retry]로 기준치·상한 조정 (core/config.py). 환경변수 &gt; .env &gt; cta.toml" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="safe"><mxGeometry x="15" y="345" width="550" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e83" value="generate_with_gates" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.98;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.05;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v4" target="safe"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1160" y="200"/><mxPoint x="1160" y="540"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e84" value="run_writer(탈락 사유 포함 지침서)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.2;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.7;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="safe" target="engine"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e85" value="ask ⏸ → interrupt" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.85;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.82;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="engine" target="safe"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="state" value=".cta/ 상태 저장소 — 생성물은 제안으로 보관, cta apply를 쳐야만 소스 반영(v4 Step 3)" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="1000" width="580" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v86" value="proposals/ 제안&#xa;cta diff → apply / discard" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="state"><mxGeometry x="15" y="38" width="170" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v87" value="escalations/ 사람 확인 항목&#xa;종료 코드 3 → cta resolve" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="state"><mxGeometry x="200" y="38" width="180" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v88" value="memos/ 판단 메모 (수정)&#xa;상황 요약 + 임베딩 벡터 저장" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=9;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="state"><mxGeo