"v4" source="v10" target="v11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e18" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v4" source="v11" target="v12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v19" value="게이트 재시도 소진 → 사람 확인(종료 3) · 품질 미달(종료 2). --engine deep: --record 파일 / --replay 파일 로 LLM 호출 녹음·재생(기록과 어긋나면 실패, 실호출 폴백 없음). 실행은 sandbox(local 기본 / docker)에서 선택한 테스트만 돈다(R5)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="v4"><mxGeometry x="60" y="135" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v20" value="B. cta maintain" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;horizontal=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="v3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="230" width="1740" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v21" value="cta maintain --diff HEAD~1&#xa;[--plan-only] [--intent 의도]&#xa;[--impact]" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="60" y="40" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v22" value="변경 추출 adapters/changes.py&#xa;git diff → 변경 심볼 + 단서&#xa;(시그니처·접근 제어자·주석만·커밋 메시지·이슈) · 수정 전 소스" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="270" y="40" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v23" value="건별 의도 분류 llm/intent.py&#xa;bug_fix / refactor / new_feature / trivial / unclear&#xa;+ 확신도·근거·분석. 실패 → unclear · --intent면 확정" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="570" y="40" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v24" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="774" y="32" width="34" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v25" value="기존 테스트 찾기 + 검증 실행 + 영향 범위&#xa;TestLocator(COVERS 실측 → 참조 파싱 폴백) → pass / fail / none&#xa;ImpactFinder(CALLS 추정 → 호출자·확신도) → 화면·지침서만" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="870" y="40" width="230" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v21" target="v22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v22" target="v23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v23" target="v25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v29" value="규칙표&#xa;core/pipeline/decide.py&#xa;의도 × 테스트 상태&#xa;(LLM 없음, R2)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="30" width="180" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e30" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v25" target="v29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v31" value="bug_fix · new_feature → create_test → A의 [3/4]~[4/4] 경로&#xa;bug_fix: 재발 방지 테스트(⑥회귀 게이트: 수정 전 코드에서 실패해야)&#xa;new_feature: 기능 테스트 → 제안" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="50" width="320" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v32" value="no_action&#xa;refactor+통과(동작 보존 확인) · trivial(주석·공백만)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="115" width="320" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v33" value="escalate / ask → .cta/escalations 저장 후 멈춤 (종료 3)&#xa;refactor+실패: 기대값을 고치지 않고 실패 내용·의심 위치만 정리(R3)&#xa;unclear / refactor+테스트 없음: 사람에게 묻기" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce8f6;strokeColor=#b5739d;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="170" width="320" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e34" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v29" target="v31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e35" value="refactor+pass · trivial" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v29" target="v32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1240" y="135"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e36" value="refactor+fail · unclear" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v20" source="v29" target="v33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1240" y="200"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v37" value="화면에는 변경 건마다 ①의도 판단 ②조치 블록(판단·확신도·근거·영향 범위·할 일)을 적는다(ADR-0015 D2). 확신도는 표시용이며 코드는 이 값으로 분기하지 않는다. --plan-only는 규칙표까지만. 판단 메모(.cta/memos)는 이름 일치 + 상황 임베딩(하이브리드)으로 찾아 참고로 보여 준다. --impact: create_test인 건의 확신 high 호출자를 파생 건(↳)으로 추가해 같은 규칙표를 태운다(깊이 1, [impact] max_callers). 사람 확인이 하나라도 있으면 종료 3." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="v20"><mxGeometry x="60" y="235" width="1600" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v38" value="C. cta resolve" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;horizontal=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="v3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="530" width="1740" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v39" value="cta resolve &lt;id&gt; --intended |&#xa;--test-issue | --proceed | --as | --skip" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="60" y="40" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v40" value="저장된 사람 확인 항목 읽기&#xa;.cta/escalations/&lt;id&gt;.json&#xa;재개 지점 = 테스트 작성 단계 진입(ADR-0015 D3)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="280" y="40" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v41" value="사람 결정 → 지침·허용 목록 cli/resolve_cmd.py&#xa;--intended: 실패 테스트 기대값을 새 동작 기준으로&#xa;--test-issue: 테스트를 동작 기준으로 재작성&#xa;--as 의도: 규칙표부터 다시(LLM 없음) · --skip: 기록만" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="600" y="40" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v42" value="A의 [3/4]~[4/4] 경로로 재개&#xa;허용 목록 = 실패한 테스트 메서드만 assert 변경 허용&#xa;나머지는 ①AssertIntegrity 게이트가 보호" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="970" y="40" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v43" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="1214" y="32" width="34" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v44" value=".cta/proposals 제안&#xa;+ .cta/memos 판단 메모&#xa;(상황 요약 + 임베딩)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="40" width="170" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v45" value="LLM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="1454" y="32" width="34" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v46" value="종료 0 / 2 / 3" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="40" width="110" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e47" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v39" target="v40"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e48" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v40" target="v41"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e49" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v41" target="v42"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e50" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v42" target="v44"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e51" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v38" source="v44" target="v46"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v52" value="사람이 명시적으로 고른 선택지만 실행한다 — R3는 '사람 확인 없는' 기대값 갱신을 막는 규칙이다. 판단 메모는 상황 요약(커밋 메시지·대상·분석, 자연어)을 임베딩해 저장하고, 다음 maintain에서 이름 일치 + 코사인 유사도로 참고 자료가 된다(ADR-0026 D3)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="v38"><mxGeometry x="60" y="135" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v53" value="D. cta diff&#xa;apply · discard" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;horizontal=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="v3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="730" width="1740" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v54" value="cta diff [이름]" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v53"><mxGeometry x="60" y="35" width="120" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v55" value=".cta/proposals 읽기 cli/proposals.py&#xa;제안 내용을 diff 형식으로 출력" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v53"><mxGeometry x="250" y="35" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v56" value="사람 검토" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce8f6;strokeColor=#b5739d;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v53"><mxGeometry x="570" y="35" width="130" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v57" value="cta apply [이름|--all]&#xa;테스트 트리(src/test)에 쓰기 — 이때만 소스 반영" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v53"><mxGeometry x="770" y="35" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v58" value="종료 0" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v53"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="35" width="100" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e59" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v53" source="v54" target="v55"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e60" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v53" source="v55" target="v56"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e61" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v53" source="v56" target="v57"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e62" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v53" source="v57" target="v58"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v63" value="cta discard → 제안 폐기 (소스 무변경)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v53"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="35" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v64" value="생성물은 apply 전까지 소스에 반영되지 않는다(v4 Step 3). CI에서는 종료 코드로 분기(사용가이드 §13)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="v53"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="1200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v65" value="E. cta graph&#xa;eval · demo" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;horizontal=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="v3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="880" width="1740" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v66" value="cta graph [--coverage]" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v65"><mxGeometry x="60" y="35" width="130" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v67" value="Java 소스 파싱 adapters/graph_builder.py + calls.py&#xa;노드 · DECLARES · CREATES · CALLS(확신도, main만)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v65"><mxGeometry x="260" y="35" width="270" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v68" value="JaCoCo 실측 adapters/coverage.py&#xa;테스트 → 메서드 COVERS 엣지 (--coverage)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v65"><mxGeometry x="600" y="35" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v69" value="graph/neo4j_store.py 적재&#xa;(접속 실패 → 파싱 폴백, graph_access.py)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v65"><mxGeometry x="920" y="35" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v70" value="query_code_graph(callers 포함) · TestLocator · ImpactFinder&#xa;&quot;기존 테스트 찾기&quot;는 실측, 영향 범위는 추정 표기" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v65"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="35" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v71" value="종료 0 / 1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v65"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="35" width="100" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e72" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v65" source="v66" target="v67"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e73" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v65" source="v67" target="v68"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e74" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v65" source="v68" target="v69"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e75" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v65" source="v69" target="v70"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e76" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="v65" source="v70" target="v71"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v77" value="cta eval [--intents] — 골든 케이스·의도 세트로 분류 정확도·unclear 비율 실측 (cli/eval_cmd.py · eval_intents.py)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v65"><mxGeometry x="60" y="140" width="640" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v78" value="cta demo — 저장된 LLM 호출 기록(카세트)으로 대표 시나리오 SC-001~004 재생, 비용 0 (cli/demo_cmd.py)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="v65"><mxGeometry x="730" y="140" width="640" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v79" value="공통 옵션: --non-interactive(질문 없이) · --quiet · --project(생략 시 cli/locate.py가 현재→상위→하위 폴더에서 pom.xml 탐색). 오류는 cli/hints.py가 &quot;왜 / 할 일 / 명령&quot; 세 줄로 안내." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="v65"><mxGeometry x="60" y="190" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="3. ADR-0026 변경분 — 영향 범위 · 임베딩 검색"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v1" value="ADR-0026 — &quot;코드 RAG는 벡터가 아니라 그래프&quot;: 영향 범위(누가 호출하나)는 코드 그래프의 CALLS 엣지(정적 추정 + 확신도)로, 임베딩 검색은 자연어(판단 메모)에만. 굵은 테두리 = 신규 모듈, (수정) = 기존 모듈 변경." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1700" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="변경된 메서드&#xa;(git diff → ChangedSymbol)&#xa;예: OrderService#findById" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="370" width="220" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="laneA" value="A. 영향 범위 — 코드 그래프가 답한다 (구조 질의 = 정답, 확정 관계 3종 + 추정 CALLS 1종)" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="80" width="1440" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="adapters/java/graph_builder.py (수정)&#xa;main 트리 클래스·메서드 파싱&#xa;→ ClassSource" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneA"><mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="230" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="adapters/java/calls.py  [신규]&#xa;extract_calls — CALLS 추정, 확신도 규칙:&#xa;· 같은 클래스 `이름(` → high&#xa;· 선언 타입이 프로젝트 클래스 X, X에 이름 있음 → high&#xa;· 타입 미상 + 이름 유일 → medium&#xa;· 그 밖(밖 타입·중복·생성자·재귀) → 엣지 없음" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;strokeWidth=3;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="laneA"><mxGeometry x="320" y="40" width="320" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v5" value="graph/model.py · store.py · neo4j_store.py (수정)&#xa;GraphEdge(kind=CALLS, confidence, excerpt)&#xa;edges_in(project, key, kind)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneA"><mxGeometry x="710" y="50" width="270" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v6" value="graph/answers.py (수정)&#xa;callers 쿼리 실응답 — &quot;정적 추정&quot; 표기 + [high/medium]&#xa;(query_code_graph 도구 · 도구 수 6 그대로, R4)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneA"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="40" width="300" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v7" value="graph/impact.py  [신규]&#xa;GraphImpactFinder → list[Caller]&#xa;(폴백: calls.StaticImpactFinder)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;strokeWidth=3;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="laneA"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="105" width="300" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v8" value="core/pipeline (수정) — Caller · ImpactFinder 포트&#xa;maintain.analyze_changes: 건마다 호출자 수집&#xa;--impact: create_test 건의 high 호출자 → 파생 건 ↳ (의도 상속, 깊이 1, [impact] max_callers=3)&#xa;decide: 호출자는 지침서 내용에만 → kind·reason 불변" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneA"><mxGeometry x="20" y="200" width="520" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v9" value="cli (수정) — maintain --impact · render &quot;영향 범위&quot; 줄 · ↳ 파생 건 표시&#xa;지침서: &quot;영향 범위(정적 추정): OrderController#get [high] — return service.findById(id); …&quot;&#xa;&quot;호출자를 거쳐 변경된 동작이 드러나는 시나리오를 1개 이상 시험하라&quot;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneA"><mxGeometry x="610" y="200" width="520" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v10" value="규칙표 decide()&#xa;(의도 × 테스트 상태)&#xa;✗ CALLS는 넣지 않는다 (R2)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillC