xitDy=0;entryX=0.9;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="laneA" source="v7" target="v8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1200" y="180"/><mxPoint x="488" y="180"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e17" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="laneA" source="v8" target="v9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e18" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;" edge="1" parent="laneA" source="v9" target="v10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e19" value="대상 Class#method" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v2" target="laneA"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="laneB" value="B. 판단 메모 검색 — 임베딩은 자연어에만 (v4 4.1 ④). 참고일 뿐 규칙표를 우회하지 못한다" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="450" width="1440" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v20" value="cli/resolve_cmd.py (수정)&#xa;사람 결정 시 상황 요약 생성&#xa;situation_text = 커밋 메시지 첫 줄 + 대상 + 분석 (코드·diff 제외)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneB"><mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="330" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v21" value="llm/embeddings.py  [신규]&#xa;EmbeddingClient · GatewayEmbeddingClient(/embeddings)&#xa;Recording/ReplayEmbeddingClient(글→벡터 기록, 폴백 없음 R7)&#xa;cosine() 순수 파이썬 — 새 의존성 0" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;strokeWidth=3;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="laneB"><mxGeometry x="420" y="40" width="360" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v22" value="llm/config.py (수정)&#xa;make_embedding_client() — 미설정이면 None&#xa;CTA_EMBEDDING_MODEL (기본 text-embedding-3-small)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneB"><mxGeometry x="850" y="50" width="300" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v23" value="사내 LLM 게이트웨이&#xa;/openai/deployments/{dep}/embeddings&#xa;주소·키는 .env로만" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneB"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="50" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v24" value=".cta/memos/*.json (수정)&#xa;Memo(target, category, decision, note, created_at,&#xa;     situation, embedding)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneB"><mxGeometry x="20" y="170" width="330" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v25" value="cli/memos.py find_similar (수정) — 하이브리드&#xa;① 이름 일치(같은 메서드 → 같은 클래스, 결정적)&#xa;② 빈 자리 = 코사인 ≥ SIMILARITY_MIN(0.35) 높은 순 · 최대 3건" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="laneB"><mxGeometry x="420" y="170" width="360" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v26" value="cli/maintain_cmd.py (수정)&#xa;질의 = situation_text(커밋 메시지, 대상) 임베딩&#xa;임베딩할 메모·설정 없으면 이름 일치만(화면 표시)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;spac